  "integration": {
    "applyOnce": true,
    "sharedWorldTerm": "Same view-ray optical depth for land, water, buildings, trees and terrain. Atmosphere-rendered sky/reflections must not receive duplicate atmospheric passes.",
    "noNearClearBubble": true,
    "localFog": "Preserve night-fog/marine-fog layer bounds, patch masks and densitites. Base sigma from this pack; add local sigma only for physically traversed local layer. If observation already represents that local layer, fit layer plus background to total rather than adding observation and layer twice.",
    "layerColour": "Single final homogeneous mix only if airlight is common; otherwise integrate each segment front to back with its airlight. Optical-depth-weighted colour alone is not exact for layered media.",
    "regionalSeasonRanges": "All ranges describe scenario authoring envelopes, not percentiles, observations or prevalence. Uniform event defaults are deliberate conditional fallbacks. Use local data for mountain-valley inversions, SF marine fog, wildfire layers, tropical wet/dry seasons and location variation."
  },
